-- title:
--   Only votes of cluster-manager-eligible nodes are counted
-- statement:
--   For every vote collection `v`, node `n` and node id `x`: `x` is among the ids of `(v.addVote n).1` iff `x` is among the ids of `v`, or `x = n.id` and `n.isClusterManagerNode = true`.
--
--   `addVote` adds exactly the id of a node with the cluster-manager role and nothing else; the vote of a node without the role, or a vote already present, leaves the set of voters unchanged.
